[{"id":"radda-6-147-8","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"biva vraćen","en":"he/it is returned"},{"bs":"vratili smo ga","en":"We returned him"},{"bs":"vraćamo se","en":"we are returned"},{"bs":"vraćena je","en":"she/it was returned"}],"ref":"6:147","answerWord":"يُرَدُّ","answerSound":"audio/d4213ac103c3e190f44b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So if they give the lie to thee (Muhammad), say: Your Lord is a Lord of All-Embracing Mercy, and His wrath will never be withdrawn from guilty folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["فَإِن","كَذَّبُوكَ","فَقُل","رَّبُّكُمْ","ذُو","رَحْمَةٍ","وَٰسِعَةٍ","وَلَا","يُرَدُّ","بَأْسُهُۥ","عَنِ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-6-27-8","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćamo se","en":"we are returned"},{"bs":"vraćena je","en":"she/it was returned"},{"bs":"vratili smo","en":"we returned"},{"bs":"vraćaju vas","en":"they return you (all)"}],"ref":"6:27","answerWord":"نُرَدُّ","answerSound":"audio/545e525dd6148cfde9f8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If thou couldst see when they are set before the Fire and say: Oh, would that we might return! Then would we not deny the revelations of our Lord but we would be of the believers!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","تَرَىٰٓ","إِذْ","وُقِفُوا۟","عَلَى","ٱلنَّارِ","فَقَالُوا۟","يَٰلَيْتَنَا","نُرَدُّ","وَلَا","نُكَذِّبَ","بِـَٔايَٰتِ","رَبِّنَا","وَنَكُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-9-94-21","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćate se","en":"you (all) are returned"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they are returned"},{"bs":"vratili su ga","en":"they returned it"},{"bs":"vratite ga!","en":"(you all) return it!"}],"ref":"9:94","answerWord":"تُرَدُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/86e9e30c4fffbec86d87.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They will make excuse to you (Muslims) when ye return unto them. Say: Make no excuse, for we shall not believe you. Allah hath told us tidings of you. Allah and His messenger will see your conduct, and then ye will be brought back unto Him Who knoweth the Invisible as well as the Visible, and He will tell you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["يَعْتَذِرُونَ","إِلَيْكُمْ","إِذَا","رَجَعْتُمْ","إِلَيْهِمْ","قُل","لَّا","تَعْتَذِرُوا۟","لَن","نُّؤْمِنَ","لَكُمْ","قَدْ","نَبَّأَنَا","ٱللَّهُ","مِنْ","أَخْبَارِكُمْ","وَسَيَرَى","ٱللَّهُ","عَمَلَكُمْ","وَرَسُولُهُۥ","ثُمَّ","تُرَدُّونَ","إِلَىٰ","عَٰلِمِ","ٱلْغَيْبِ","وَٱلشَّهَٰدَةِ","فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-12-65-5","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćena je","en":"she/it was returned"},{"bs":"vraćeni su","en":"they were returned"},{"bs":"vraćaju vas","en":"they return you (all)"},{"bs":"biva vraćen","en":"he/it is returned"}],"ref":"12:65","answerWord":"رُدَّتْ","answerSound":"audio/eb51b11e8fba4a09f5a2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they opened their belongings they discovered that their merchandise had been returned to them. They said: O our father! What (more) can we ask? Here is our merchandise returned to us. We shall get provision for our folk and guard our brother, and we shall have the extra measure of a camel (load). This (that we bring now) is a light measure.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","فَتَحُوا۟","مَتَٰعَهُمْ","وَجَدُوا۟","بِضَٰعَتَهُمْ","رُدَّتْ","إِلَيْهِمْ","قَالُوا۟","يَٰٓأَبَانَا","مَا","نَبْغِى","هَٰذِهِۦ","بِضَٰعَتُنَا","رُدَّتْ","إِلَيْنَا","وَنَمِيرُ","أَهْلَنَا","وَنَحْفَظُ","أَخَانَا","وَنَزْدَادُ","كَيْلَ","بَعِيرٍ","ذَٰلِكَ","كَيْلٌ","يَسِيرٌ"],"marked":[5,13],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-3-100-10","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćaju vas","en":"they return you (all)"},{"bs":"vraćeni su","en":"they were returned"},{"bs":"vraćen sam","en":"I was returned"},{"bs":"i vraćamo se","en":"and we are returned"}],"ref":"3:100","answerWord":"يَرُدُّوكُم","answerSound":"audio/7774061aa441e5f9f72d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! If ye obey a party of those who have received the Scripture they will make you disbelievers after your belief.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِن","تُطِيعُوا۟","فَرِيقًا","مِّنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","يَرُدُّوكُم","بَعْدَ","إِيمَٰنِكُمْ","كَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-4-59-14","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga vratite!","en":"so (you all) return it!"},{"bs":"i odbio je","en":"and he/it repelled"},{"bs":"pa su vratili","en":"so they returned"},{"bs":"i vraćamo se","en":"and we are returned"}],"ref":"4:59","answerWord":"فَرُدُّوهُ","answerSound":"audio/2614e05fd12b94cfdbcb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Obey Allah, and obey the messenger and those of you who are in authority; and if ye have a dispute concerning any matter, refer it to Allah and the messenger if ye are (in truth) believers in Allah and the Last Day. That is better and more seemly in the end.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","أَطِيعُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُوا۟","ٱلرَّسُولَ","وَأُو۟لِى","ٱلْأَمْرِ","مِنكُمْ","فَإِن","تَنَٰزَعْتُمْ","فِى","شَىْءٍ","فَرُدُّوهُ","إِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱلرَّسُولِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","تُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","ذَٰلِكَ","خَيْرٌ","وَأَحْسَنُ","تَأْوِيلًا"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-4-83-10","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vratili su ga","en":"they returned it"},{"bs":"vraćaju vas","en":"they return you (all)"},{"bs":"vratili smo ga","en":"We returned him"},{"bs":"i vraćeni su","en":"and they were returned"}],"ref":"4:83","answerWord":"رَدُّوهُ","answerSound":"audio/582399dd20387498ea91.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if any tidings, whether of safety or fear, come unto them, they noise it abroad, whereas if they had referred it to the messenger and to such of them as are in authority, those among them who are able to think out the matter would have known it. If it had not been for the grace of Allah upon you and His mercy ye would have followed Satan, save a few (of you).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","جَآءَهُمْ","أَمْرٌ","مِّنَ","ٱلْأَمْنِ","أَوِ","ٱلْخَوْفِ","أَذَاعُوا۟","بِهِۦ","وَلَوْ","رَدُّوهُ","إِلَى","ٱلرَّسُولِ","وَإِلَىٰٓ","أُو۟لِى","ٱلْأَمْرِ","مِنْهُمْ","لَعَلِمَهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَسْتَنۢبِطُونَهُۥ","مِنْهُمْ","وَلَوْلَا","فَضْلُ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَيْكُمْ","وَرَحْمَتُهُۥ","لَٱتَّبَعْتُمُ","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنَ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-4-86-7","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vratite ga!","en":"(you all) return it!"},{"bs":"biva vraćen","en":"he/it is returned"},{"bs":"vraćeni su","en":"they were returned"},{"bs":"i bit ćete vraćeni","en":"and you (all) will be returned"}],"ref":"4:86","answerWord":"رُدُّوهَآ","answerSound":"audio/09bf69b762560c14ad25.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When ye are greeted with a greeting, greet ye with a better than it or return it. Lo! Allah taketh count of all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","حُيِّيتُم","بِتَحِيَّةٍ","فَحَيُّوا۟","بِأَحْسَنَ","مِنْهَآ","أَوْ","رُدُّوهَآ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","حَسِيبًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-6-28-9","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćeni su","en":"they were returned"},{"bs":"vratili smo","en":"we returned"},{"bs":"pa ga vratite!","en":"so (you all) return it!"},{"bs":"vratili smo ga","en":"We returned him"}],"ref":"6:28","answerWord":"رُدُّوا۟","answerSound":"audio/c17e6d696c670720cf0f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but that hath become clear unto them which before they used to hide. And if they were sent back they would return unto that which they are forbidden. Lo! they are liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["بَلْ","بَدَا","لَهُم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","يُخْفُونَ","مِن","قَبْلُ","وَلَوْ","رُدُّوا۟","لَعَادُوا۟","لِمَا","نُهُوا۟","عَنْهُ","وَإِنَّهُمْ","لَكَٰذِبُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-9-105-7","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"i bit ćete vraćeni","en":"and you (all) will be returned"},{"bs":"vratite ih","en":"return them"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they are returned"},{"bs":"vraćena je","en":"she/it was returned"}],"ref":"9:105","answerWord":"وَسَتُرَدُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/12cce317cef511ab699a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And say (unto them): Act! Allah will behold your actions, and (so will) His messenger and the believers, and ye will be brought back to the Knower of the Invisible and the Visible, and He will tell you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["وَقُلِ","ٱعْمَلُوا۟","فَسَيَرَى","ٱللَّهُ","عَمَلَكُمْ","وَرَسُولُهُۥ","وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","وَسَتُرَدُّونَ","إِلَىٰ","عَٰلِمِ","ٱلْغَيْبِ","وَٱلشَّهَٰدَةِ","فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-10-30-6","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"i vraćeni su","en":"and they were returned"},{"bs":"vraćaju vas","en":"they return you (all)"},{"bs":"vratite ga!","en":"(you all) return it!"},{"bs":"vraćate se","en":"you (all) are returned"}],"ref":"10:30","answerWord":"وَرُدُّوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/6222f178f085d94fdbcd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"There doth every soul experience that which it did aforetime, and they are returned unto Allah, their rightful Lord, and that which they used to invent hath failed them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["هُنَالِكَ","تَبْلُوا۟","كُلُّ","نَفْسٍ","مَّآ","أَسْلَفَتْ","وَرُدُّوٓا۟","إِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","مَوْلَىٰهُمُ","ٱلْحَقِّ","وَضَلَّ","عَنْهُم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","يَفْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-17-6-1","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vratili smo","en":"we returned"},{"bs":"i vraćamo se","en":"and we are returned"},{"bs":"i bit ćete vraćeni","en":"and you (all) will be returned"},{"bs":"vratili su ga","en":"they returned it"}],"ref":"17:6","answerWord":"رَدَدْنَا","answerSound":"audio/152df5b842184fdf89c1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then we gave you once again your turn against them, and We aided you with wealth and children and made you more in soldiery.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","رَدَدْنَا","لَكُمُ","ٱلْكَرَّةَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","وَأَمْدَدْنَٰكُم","بِأَمْوَٰلٍ","وَبَنِينَ","وَجَعَلْنَٰكُمْ","أَكْثَرَ","نَفِيرًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-18-36-5","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćen sam","en":"I was returned"},{"bs":"pa smo ga vratili","en":"so we returned him"},{"bs":"vraćeni su","en":"they were returned"},{"bs":"vraćena je","en":"she/it was returned"}],"ref":"18:36","answerWord":"رُّدِدتُّ","answerSound":"audio/73ff0616ab44571b9d36.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"I think not that the Hour will ever come, and if indeed I am brought back unto my Lord I surely shall find better than this as a resort.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["وَمَآ","أَظُنُّ","ٱلسَّاعَةَ","قَآئِمَةً","وَلَئِن","رُّدِدتُّ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّى","لَأَجِدَنَّ","خَيْرًا","مِّنْهَا","مُنقَلَبًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-28-13-0","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo ga vratili","en":"so we returned him"},{"bs":"i vraćeni su","en":"and they were returned"},{"bs":"vraćate se","en":"you (all) are returned"},{"bs":"vratili su ga","en":"they returned it"}],"ref":"28:13","answerWord":"فَرَدَدْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/77e2f0e044e19146b6b1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So We restored him to his mother that she might be comforted and not grieve, and that she might know that the promise of Allah is true. But most of them know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["فَرَدَدْنَٰهُ","إِلَىٰٓ","أُمِّهِۦ","كَىْ","تَقَرَّ","عَيْنُهَا","وَلَا","تَحْزَنَ","وَلِتَعْلَمَ","أَنَّ","وَعْدَ","ٱللَّهِ","حَقٌّ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","أَكْثَرَهُمْ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-33-25-0","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"i odbio je","en":"and he/it repelled"},{"bs":"vraćate se","en":"you (all) are returned"},{"bs":"vraćeni su","en":"they were returned"},{"bs":"pa ga vratite!","en":"so (you all) return it!"}],"ref":"33:25","answerWord":"وَرَدَّ","answerSound":"audio/a0cf9bafa8ce62694a71.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Allah repulsed the disbelievers in their wrath; they gained no good. Allah averted their attack from the believers. Allah is ever Strong, Mighty.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["وَرَدَّ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","بِغَيْظِهِمْ","لَمْ","يَنَالُوا۟","خَيْرًا","وَكَفَى","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","ٱلْقِتَالَ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","قَوِيًّا","عَزِيزًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-38-33-0","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vratite ih","en":"return them"},{"bs":"vraćaju vas","en":"they return you (all)"},{"bs":"vraćeni su","en":"they were returned"},{"bs":"vraćate se","en":"you (all) are returned"}],"ref":"38:33","answerWord":"رُدُّوهَا","answerSound":"audio/911675d0a7df533546b5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Then he said): Bring them back to me, and fell to slashing (with his sword their) legs and necks.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["رُدُّوهَا","عَلَىَّ","فَطَفِقَ","مَسْحًۢا","بِٱلسُّوقِ","وَٱلْأَعْنَاقِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"radda-95-5-1","words":["verb:radda"],"options":[{"bs":"vratili smo ga","en":"We returned him"},{"bs":"vraćate se","en":"you (all) are returned"},{"bs":"i vraćeni su","en":"and they were returned"},{"bs":"vratili smo","en":"we returned"}],"ref":"95:5","answerWord":"رَدَدْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/137963238e7a61a5a46c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then we reduced him to the lowest of the low,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti, odbiti","en":"to return, to send back, to reject"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","رَدَدْنَٰهُ","أَسْفَلَ","سَٰفِلِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَدَّ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-3-144-13","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) turned back"},{"bs":"vraća se","en":"he/it turns back"},{"bs":"pa su se vratili","en":"so they turned back"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they turn back"}],"ref":"3:144","answerWord":"ٱنقَلَبْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/8838f49ee2a0e9e67719.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Muhammad is but a messenger, messengers (the like of whom) have passed away before him. Will it be that, when he dieth or is slain, ye will turn back on your heels? He who turneth back on his heels doth no hurt to Allah, and Allah will reward the thankful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["وَمَا","مُحَمَّدٌ","إِلَّا","رَسُولٌ","قَدْ","خَلَتْ","مِن","قَبْلِهِ","ٱلرُّسُلُ","أَفَإِي۟ن","مَّاتَ","أَوْ","قُتِلَ","ٱنقَلَبْتُمْ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَعْقَٰبِكُمْ","وَمَن","يَنقَلِبْ","عَلَىٰ","عَقِبَيْهِ","فَلَن","يَضُرَّ","ٱللَّهَ","شَيْـًٔا","وَسَيَجْزِى","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلشَّٰكِرِينَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-3-144-17","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"vraća se","en":"he/it turns back"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they turn back"},{"bs":"pa su se vratili","en":"so they turned back"},{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it turned back"}],"ref":"3:144","answerWord":"يَنقَلِبْ","answerSound":"audio/990e709ff5757acf6513.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Muhammad is but a messenger, messengers (the like of whom) have passed away before him. Will it be that, when he dieth or is slain, ye will turn back on your heels? He who turneth back on his heels doth no hurt to Allah, and Allah will reward the thankful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["وَمَا","مُحَمَّدٌ","إِلَّا","رَسُولٌ","قَدْ","خَلَتْ","مِن","قَبْلِهِ","ٱلرُّسُلُ","أَفَإِي۟ن","مَّاتَ","أَوْ","قُتِلَ","ٱنقَلَبْتُمْ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَعْقَٰبِكُمْ","وَمَن","يَنقَلِبْ","عَلَىٰ","عَقِبَيْهِ","فَلَن","يَضُرَّ","ٱللَّهَ","شَيْـًٔا","وَسَيَجْزِى","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلشَّٰكِرِينَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-12-62-9","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"vratili su se","en":"they turned back"},{"bs":"i vratit će se","en":"and he returns"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they turn back"},{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) turned back"}],"ref":"12:62","answerWord":"ٱنقَلَبُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/44837fb6cf113e176af5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said unto his young men: Place their merchandise in their saddlebags, so that they may know it when they go back to their folk, and so will come again.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","لِفِتْيَٰنِهِ","ٱجْعَلُوا۟","بِضَٰعَتَهُمْ","فِى","رِحَالِهِمْ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَعْرِفُونَهَآ","إِذَا","ٱنقَلَبُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰٓ","أَهْلِهِمْ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَرْجِعُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-3-127-7","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"pa se vraćaju","en":"so they turn back"},{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it turned back"},{"bs":"i vratit će se","en":"and he returns"},{"bs":"pa su se vratili","en":"so they turned back"}],"ref":"3:127","answerWord":"فَيَنقَلِبُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4158fcce99e95cc5133a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That He may cut off a part of those who disbelieve, or overwhelm them so that they retire, frustrated.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["لِيَقْطَعَ","طَرَفًا","مِّنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","أَوْ","يَكْبِتَهُمْ","فَيَنقَلِبُوا۟","خَآئِبِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-3-174-0","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su se vratili","en":"so they turned back"},{"bs":"pa se vraćaju","en":"so they turn back"},{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) turned back"},{"bs":"vraća se","en":"he/it turns back"}],"ref":"3:174","answerWord":"فَٱنقَلَبُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/3c9e21d7f0b549548cec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So they returned with grace and favour from Allah, and no harm touched them. They followed the good pleasure of Allah, and Allah is of Infinite Bounty.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["فَٱنقَلَبُوا۟","بِنِعْمَةٍ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَفَضْلٍ","لَّمْ","يَمْسَسْهُمْ","سُوٓءٌ","وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟","رِضْوَٰنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","ذُو","فَضْلٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-7-119-2","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"i vratili su se","en":"and they turned back"},{"bs":"pa se vraćaju","en":"so they turn back"},{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it turned back"},{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) turned back"}],"ref":"7:119","answerWord":"وَٱنقَلَبُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/3e554ce3dde5564b6947.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus were they there defeated and brought low.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["فَغُلِبُوا۟","هُنَالِكَ","وَٱنقَلَبُوا۟","صَٰغِرِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-22-11-15","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it turned back"},{"bs":"vraća se","en":"he/it turns back"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they turn back"},{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) turned back"}],"ref":"22:11","answerWord":"ٱنقَلَبَ","answerSound":"audio/5fb0e18a8a274f8e30fa.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And among mankind is he who worshippeth Allah upon a narrow marge so that if good befalleth him he is content therewith, but if a trial befalleth him, he falleth away utterly. He loseth both the world and the Hereafter. That is the sheer loss.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["وَمِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","مَن","يَعْبُدُ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلَىٰ","حَرْفٍ","فَإِنْ","أَصَابَهُۥ","خَيْرٌ","ٱطْمَأَنَّ","بِهِۦ","وَإِنْ","أَصَابَتْهُ","فِتْنَةٌ","ٱنقَلَبَ","عَلَىٰ","وَجْهِهِۦ","خَسِرَ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَٱلْءَاخِرَةَ","ذَٰلِكَ","هُوَ","ٱلْخُسْرَانُ","ٱلْمُبِينُ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-26-227-18","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they turn back"},{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) turned back"},{"bs":"vraća se","en":"he/it turns back"},{"bs":"vratili su se","en":"they turned back"}],"ref":"26:227","answerWord":"يَنقَلِبُونَ","answerSound":"audio/44de6dda61a1e98e5522.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Save those who believe and do good works, and remember Allah much, and vindicate themselves after they have been wronged. Those who do wrong will come to know by what a (great) reverse they will be overturned!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","وَذَكَرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","كَثِيرًا","وَٱنتَصَرُوا۟","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","ظُلِمُوا۟","وَسَيَعْلَمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَىَّ","مُنقَلَبٍ","يَنقَلِبُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-48-12-4","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"vraća se","en":"he/it turns back"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they turn back"},{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) turned back"},{"bs":"i vratili su se","en":"and they turned back"}],"ref":"48:12","answerWord":"يَنقَلِبَ","answerSound":"audio/2ff296906c14c9cd60a3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but ye deemed that the messenger and the believers would never return to their own folk, and that was made fairseeming in your hearts, and ye did think an evil thought, and ye were worthless folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["بَلْ","ظَنَنتُمْ","أَن","لَّن","يَنقَلِبَ","ٱلرَّسُولُ","وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَهْلِيهِمْ","أَبَدًا","وَزُيِّنَ","ذَٰلِكَ","فِى","قُلُوبِكُمْ","وَظَنَنتُمْ","ظَنَّ","ٱلسَّوْءِ","وَكُنتُمْ","قَوْمًۢا","بُورًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-83-31-4","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"vratili su se","en":"they turned back"},{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) turned back"},{"bs":"i vratit će se","en":"and he returns"},{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it turned back"}],"ref":"83:31","answerWord":"ٱنقَلَبُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4890bbf3729336326d2b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they returned to their own folk, they returned jesting;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","ٱنقَلَبُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰٓ","أَهْلِهِمُ","ٱنقَلَبُوا۟","فَكِهِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"inqalaba-84-9-0","words":["verb:inqalaba"],"options":[{"bs":"i vratit će se","en":"and he returns"},{"bs":"vratili su se","en":"they turned back"},{"bs":"pa se vraćaju","en":"so they turn back"},{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it turned back"}],"ref":"84:9","answerWord":"وَيَنقَلِبُ","answerSound":"audio/8ba3297423e6b49be8ad.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And will return unto his folk in joy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se, preokrenuti se","en":"to turn back, to return"},"passage":["وَيَنقَلِبُ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَهْلِهِۦ","مَسْرُورًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"انقَلَبَ"}},{"id":"ghashia-44-11-0","words":["verb:ghashia"],"options":[{"bs":"prekriva","en":"he/it covers"},{"bs":"prekrio ih je","en":"he/it covered them"},{"bs":"prekriva ga","en":"it covers it"},{"bs":"prekriva ih","en":"he/it covers them"}],"ref":"44:11","answerWord":"يَغْشَى","answerSound":"audio/ec50187649ad14ec7e58.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That will envelop the people. This will be a painful torment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekriti, obuzeti","en":"to cover, to overwhelm"},"passage":["يَغْشَى","ٱلنَّاسَ","هَٰذَا","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"غَشِيَ"}},{"id":"ghashia-20-78-3","words":["verb:ghashia"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih je prekrilo","en":"so there covered them"},{"bs":"prekriva","en":"he/it covers"},{"bs":"prekriva ga","en":"it covers it"},{"bs":"prekriva ih","en":"he/it covers them"}],"ref":"20:78","answerWord":"فَغَشِيَهُم","answerSound":"audio/46d4aea98af012f1ba2b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then Pharaoh followed them with his hosts and there covered them that which did cover them of the sea.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekriti, obuzeti","en":"to cover, to overwhelm"},"passage":["فَأَتْبَعَهُمْ","فِرْعَوْنُ","بِجُنُودِهِۦ","فَغَشِيَهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْيَمِّ","مَا","غَشِيَهُمْ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"غَشِيَ"}},{"id":"ghashia-29-55-1","words":["verb:ghashia"],"options":[{"bs":"prekriva ih","en":"he/it covers them"},{"bs":"biva obuzet","en":"he/it is overcome"},{"bs":"prekriva","en":"he/it covers"},{"bs":"pa ih je prekrilo","en":"so there covered them"}],"ref":"29:55","answerWord":"يَغْشَىٰهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/8dd55bcef3c57f2b7993.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On the day when the doom will overwhelm them from above them and from underneath their feet, and He will say: Taste what ye used to do!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekriti, obuzeti","en":"to cover, to overwhelm"},"passage":["يَوْمَ","يَغْشَىٰهُمُ","ٱلْعَذَابُ","مِن","فَوْقِهِمْ","وَمِن","تَحْتِ","أَرْجُلِهِمْ","وَيَقُولُ","ذُوقُوا۟","مَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"غَشِيَ"}},{"id":"ghashia-31-32-1","words":["verb:ghashia"],"options":[{"bs":"prekrio ih je","en":"he/it covered them"},{"bs":"prekriva","en":"he/it covers"},{"bs":"prekriva ih","en":"he/it covers them"},{"bs":"prekriva ga","en":"it covers it"}],"ref":"31:32","answerWord":"غَشِيَهُم","answerSound":"audio/ea037bee0b2000d74e95.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if a wave enshroudeth them like awnings, they cry unto Allah, making their faith pure for Him only. But when He bringeth them safe to land, some of them compromise. None denieth Our signs save every traitor ingrate.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekriti, obuzeti","en":"to cover, to overwhelm"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","غَشِيَهُم","مَّوْجٌ","كَٱلظُّلَلِ","دَعَوُا۟","ٱللَّهَ","مُخْلِصِينَ","لَهُ","ٱلدِّينَ","فَلَمَّا","نَجَّىٰهُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلْبَرِّ","فَمِنْهُم","مُّقْتَصِدٌ","وَمَا","يَجْحَدُ","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ","إِلَّا","كُلُّ","خَتَّارٍ","كَفُورٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"غَشِيَ"}},{"id":"tabaa-30-59-1","words":["verb:tabaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pečati","en":"seals"},{"bs":"i zapečatio je","en":"and he/it sealed"},{"bs":"i pečatimo","en":"and we seal"},{"bs":"i zapečaćen je","en":"and he/it was sealed"}],"ref":"30:59","answerWord":"يَطْبَعُ","answerSound":"audio/1ee4175a303f0c84b691.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus doth Allah seal the hearts of those who know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zapečatiti, štampati","en":"to seal, to print"},"passage":["كَذَٰلِكَ","يَطْبَعُ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"طَبَعَ"}},{"id":"tabaa-7-100-13","words":["verb:tabaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i pečatimo","en":"and we seal"},{"bs":"pečati","en":"seals"},{"bs":"i zapečatio je","en":"and he/it sealed"},{"bs":"i zapečaćen je","en":"and he/it was sealed"}],"ref":"7:100","answerWord":"وَنَطْبَعُ","answerSound":"audio/c799607484e255d13224.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Is it not an indication to those who inherit the land after its people (who thus reaped the consequence of evil-doing) that, if We will, We can smite them for their sins and print upon their hearts so that they hear not?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zapečatiti, štampati","en":"to seal, to print"},"passage":["أَوَلَمْ","يَهْدِ","لِلَّذِينَ","يَرِثُونَ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","أَهْلِهَآ","أَن","لَّوْ","نَشَآءُ","أَصَبْنَٰهُم","بِذُنُوبِهِمْ","وَنَطْبَعُ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِهِمْ","فَهُمْ","لَا","يَسْمَعُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"طَبَعَ"}},{"id":"tabaa-10-74-18","words":["verb:tabaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pečatimo","en":"we seal"},{"bs":"i zapečaćen je","en":"and he/it was sealed"},{"bs":"i zapečatio je","en":"and he/it sealed"},{"bs":"pečati","en":"seals"}],"ref":"10:74","answerWord":"نَطْبَعُ","answerSound":"audio/2fadc67bfb809268a1a9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then, after him, We sent messengers unto their folk, and they brought them clear proofs. But they were not ready to believe in that which they before denied. Thus print We on the hearts of the transgressors.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zapečatiti, štampati","en":"to seal, to print"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","بَعَثْنَا","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِۦ","رُسُلًا","إِلَىٰ","قَوْمِهِمْ","فَجَآءُوهُم","بِٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","فَمَا","كَانُوا۟","لِيُؤْمِنُوا۟","بِمَا","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِهِۦ","مِن","قَبْلُ","كَذَٰلِكَ","نَطْبَعُ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِ","ٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"طَبَعَ"}},{"id":"nala-2-124-16","words":["verb:nala"],"options":[{"bs":"postiže","en":"he/it attains"},{"bs":"postiže ga","en":"he/it attains him"},{"bs":"postižete","en":"you (all) attain"},{"bs":"postiže ih","en":"he/it attains them"}],"ref":"2:124","answerWord":"يَنَالُ","answerSound":"audio/99d311eef9d8480dc03f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when his Lord tried Abraham with (His) commands, and he fulfilled them, He said: Lo! I have appointed thee a leader for mankind. (Abraham) said: And of my offspring (will there be leaders)? He said: My covenant includeth not wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postići, dobiti","en":"to attain, to obtain"},"passage":["وَإِذِ","ٱبْتَلَىٰٓ","إِبْرَٰهِۦمَ","رَبُّهُۥ","بِكَلِمَٰتٍ","فَأَتَمَّهُنَّ","قَالَ","إِنِّى","جَاعِلُكَ","لِلنَّاسِ","إِمَامًا","قَالَ","وَمِن","ذُرِّيَّتِى","قَالَ","لَا","يَنَالُ","عَهْدِى","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"نالَ"}},{"id":"nala-3-92-1","words":["verb:nala"],"options":[{"bs":"postižete","en":"you (all) attain"},{"bs":"postiže","en":"he/it attains"},{"bs":"postići će ih","en":"he/it will attain them"},{"bs":"postižu","en":"they attain"}],"ref":"3:92","answerWord":"تَنَالُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/a00d4c3fca31271ead3b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye will not attain unto piety until ye spend of that which ye love. And whatsoever ye spend, Allah is Aware thereof.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postići, dobiti","en":"to attain, to obtain"},"passage":["لَن","تَنَالُوا۟","ٱلْبِرَّ","حَتَّىٰ","تُنفِقُوا۟","مِمَّا","تُحِبُّونَ","وَمَا","تُنفِقُوا۟","مِن","شَىْءٍ","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","بِهِۦ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نالَ"}},{"id":"nala-7-49-4","words":["verb:nala"],"options":[{"bs":"postiže ih","en":"he/it attains them"},{"bs":"postiže ga","en":"he/it attains him"},{"bs":"postiže","en":"he/it attains"},{"bs":"postižu","en":"they attain"}],"ref":"7:49","answerWord":"يَنَالُهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/fe063f027aefccc9f648.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Are these they of whom ye swore that Allah would not show them mercy? (Unto them it hath been said): Enter the Garden. No fear shall come upon you nor is it ye who will grieve.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postići, dobiti","en":"to attain, to obtain"},"passage":["أَهَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَقْسَمْتُمْ","لَا","يَنَالُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","بِرَحْمَةٍ","ٱدْخُلُوا۟","ٱلْجَنَّةَ","لَا","خَوْفٌ","عَلَيْكُمْ","وَلَآ","أَنتُمْ","تَحْزَنُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"نالَ"}},{"id":"nala-7-152-4","words":["verb:nala"],"options":[{"bs":"postići će ih","en":"he/it will attain them"},{"bs":"postiže ga","en":"he/it attains him"},{"bs":"postiže","en":"he/it attains"},{"bs":"postižu","en":"they attain"}],"ref":"7:152","answerWord":"سَيَنَالُهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/383602cd13e4108faa37.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Those who chose the calf (for worship), terror from their Lord and humiliation will come upon them in the life of the world. Thus do We requite those who invent a lie.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postići, dobiti","en":"to attain, to obtain"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","ٱلْعِجْلَ","سَيَنَالُهُمْ","غَضَبٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّهِمْ","وَذِلَّةٌ","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَكَذَٰلِكَ","نَجْزِى","ٱلْمُفْتَرِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"نالَ"}},{"id":"nala-22-37-1","words":["verb:nala"],"options":[{"bs":"postiže","en":"he/it attains"},{"bs":"postići će ih","en":"he/it will attain them"},{"bs":"postižu","en":"they attain"},{"bs":"postiže ga","en":"he/it attains him"}],"ref":"22:37","answerWord":"يَنَالَ","answerSound":"audio/8412870bcc98288e0df6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Their flesh and their food reach not Allah, but the devotion from you reacheth Him. Thus have We made them subject unto you that ye may magnify Allah that He hath guided you. And give good tidings (O Muhammad) to the good.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postići, dobiti","en":"to attain, to obtain"},"passage":["لَن","يَنَالَ","ٱللَّهَ","لُحُومُهَا","وَلَا","دِمَآؤُهَا","وَلَٰكِن","يَنَالُهُ","ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","مِنكُمْ","كَذَٰلِكَ","سَخَّرَهَا","لَكُمْ","لِتُكَبِّرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","هَدَىٰكُمْ","وَبَشِّرِ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نالَ"}},{"id":"nala-22-37-7","words":["verb:nala"],"options":[{"bs":"postiže ga","en":"he/it attains him"},{"bs":"postići će ih","en":"he/it will attain them"},{"bs":"postižete","en":"you (all) attain"},{"bs":"postižu","en":"they attain"}],"ref":"22:37","answerWord":"يَنَالُهُ","answerSound":"audio/89ef1cb5be7a434f0eab.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Their flesh and their food reach not Allah, but the devotion from you reacheth Him. Thus have We made them subject unto you that ye may magnify Allah that He hath guided you. And give good tidings (O Muhammad) to the good.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postići, dobiti","en":"to attain, to obtain"},"passage":["لَن","يَنَالَ","ٱللَّهَ","لُحُومُهَا","وَلَا","دِمَآؤُهَا","وَلَٰكِن","يَنَالُهُ","ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","مِنكُمْ","كَذَٰلِكَ","سَخَّرَهَا","لَكُمْ","لِتُكَبِّرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","هَدَىٰكُمْ","وَبَشِّرِ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"نالَ"}},{"id":"itmaanna-4-103-10","words":["verb:itmaanna"],"options":[{"bs":"smirili ste se","en":"you (all) were at ease"},{"bs":"i smirili su se","en":"and they were at ease"},{"bs":"smiruju se","en":"find rest"},{"bs":"smirio se","en":"he/it was at ease"}],"ref":"4:103","answerWord":"ٱطْمَأْنَنتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/f7dc2b9c6a6d41385e6c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When ye have performed the act of worship, remember Allah, standing, sitting and reclining. And when ye are in safety, observe proper worship. Worship at fixed times hath been enjoined on the believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"smiriti se, umiriti se","en":"to be at ease, to feel reassured"},"passage":["فَإِذَا","قَضَيْتُمُ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","فَٱذْكُرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","قِيَٰمًا","وَقُعُودًا","وَعَلَىٰ","جُنُوبِكُمْ","فَإِذَا","ٱطْمَأْنَنتُمْ","فَأَقِيمُوا۟","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","إِنَّ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","كَانَتْ","عَلَى","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","كِتَٰبًا","مَّوْقُوتًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"اطْمَأَنَّ"}},{"id":"itmaanna-10-7-8","words":["verb:itmaanna"],"options":[{"bs":"i smirili su se","en":"and they were at ease"},{"bs":"smirio se","en":"he/it was at ease"},{"bs":"smirili ste se","en":"you (all) were at ease"},{"bs":"smiruju se","en":"find rest"}],"ref":"10:7","answerWord":"وَٱطْمَأَنُّوا۟","answerSound":"audio/56860273fe2fbecb913c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who expect not the meeting with Us but desire the life of the world and feel secure therein, and those who are neglectful of Our revelations,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"smiriti se, umiriti se","en":"to be at ease, to feel reassured"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يَرْجُونَ","لِقَآءَنَا","وَرَضُوا۟","بِٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَٱطْمَأَنُّوا۟","بِهَا","وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُمْ","عَنْ","ءَايَٰتِنَا","غَٰفِلُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"اطْمَأَنَّ"}},{"id":"itmaanna-22-11-10","words":["verb:itmaanna"],"options":[{"bs":"smirio se","en":"he/it was at ease"},{"bs":"i smirili su se","en":"and they were at ease"},{"bs":"smiruju se","en":"find rest"},{"bs":"smirili ste se","en":"you (all) were at ease"}],"ref":"22:11","answerWord":"ٱطْمَأَنَّ","answerSound":"audio/58c2b79a46ec4680889a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And among mankind is he who worshippeth Allah upon a narrow marge so that if good befalleth him he is content therewith, but if a trial befalleth him, he falleth away utterly. He loseth both the world and the Hereafter. That is the sheer loss.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"smiriti se, umiriti se","en":"to be at ease, to feel reassured"},"passage":["وَمِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","مَن","يَعْبُدُ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلَىٰ","حَرْفٍ","فَإِنْ","أَصَابَهُۥ","خَيْرٌ","ٱطْمَأَنَّ","بِهِۦ","وَإِنْ","أَصَابَتْهُ","فِتْنَةٌ","ٱنقَلَبَ","عَلَىٰ","وَجْهِهِۦ","خَسِرَ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَٱلْءَاخِرَةَ","ذَٰلِكَ","هُوَ","ٱلْخُسْرَانُ","ٱلْمُبِينُ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"اطْمَأَنَّ"}},{"id":"aqaba-16-126-1","words":["verb:aqaba"],"options":[{"bs":"kaznite","en":"you (all) punish"},{"bs":"onda kaznite (svi)","en":"then punish (all of you)"},{"bs":"uzvratio je","en":"he/it retaliated"},{"bs":"kažnjen je","en":"he/it was punished"}],"ref":"16:126","answerWord":"عَاقَبْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/6686a30943c07dabb4db.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If ye punish, then punish with the like of that wherewith ye were afflicted. But if ye endure patiently, verily it is better for the patient.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"kazniti, uzvratiti","en":"to punish, to retaliate"},"passage":["وَإِنْ","عَاقَبْتُمْ","فَعَاقِبُوا۟","بِمِثْلِ","مَا","عُوقِبْتُم","بِهِۦ","وَلَئِن","صَبَرْتُمْ","لَهُوَ","خَيْرٌ","لِّلصَّٰبِرِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"عاقَبَ"}},{"id":"aqaba-16-126-2","words":["verb:aqaba"],"options":[{"bs":"onda kaznite (svi)","en":"then punish (all of you)"},{"bs":"kažnjen je","en":"he/it was punished"},{"bs":"kaznite","en":"you (all) punish"},{"bs":"kažnjeni ste","en":"you (all) were punished"}],"ref":"16:126","answerWord":"فَعَاقِبُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/2edbb8a887366defd57d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If ye punish, then punish with the like of that wherewith ye were afflicted. But if ye endure patiently, verily it is better for the patient.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"kazniti, uzvratiti","en":"to punish, to retaliate"},"passage":["وَإِنْ","عَاقَبْتُمْ","فَعَاقِبُوا۟","بِمِثْلِ","مَا","عُوقِبْتُم","بِهِۦ","وَلَئِن","صَبَرْتُمْ","لَهُوَ","خَيْرٌ","لِّلصَّٰبِرِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"عاقَبَ"}},{"id":"aqaba-16-126-5","words":["verb:aqaba"],"options":[{"bs":"kažnjeni ste","en":"you (all) were punished"},{"bs":"kažnjen je","en":"he/it was punished"},{"bs":"onda kaznite (svi)","en":"then punish (all of you)"},{"bs":"uzvratio je","en":"he/it retaliated"}],"ref":"16:126","answerWord":"عُوقِبْتُم","answerSound":"audio/a882c2ceba059c34fab6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If ye punish, then punish with the like of that wherewith ye were afflicted. But if ye endure patiently, verily it is better for the patient.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"kazniti, uzvratiti","en":"to punish, to retaliate"},"passage":["وَإِنْ","عَاقَبْتُمْ","فَعَاقِبُوا۟","بِمِثْلِ","مَا","عُوقِبْتُم","بِهِۦ","وَلَئِن","صَبَرْتُمْ","لَهُوَ","خَيْرٌ","لِّلصَّٰبِرِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"عاقَبَ"}},{"id":"aqaba-22-60-2","words":["verb:aqaba"],"options":[{"bs":"uzvratio je","en":"he/it retaliated"},{"bs":"pa ste uzvratili","en":"so you (all) retaliated"},{"bs":"onda kaznite (svi)","en":"then punish (all of you)"},{"bs":"kažnjeni ste","en":"you (all) were punished"}],"ref":"22:60","answerWord":"عَاقَبَ","answerSound":"audio/69ec681416ad5db231e7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That (is so). And whoso hath retaliated with the like of that which he was made to suffer and then hath (again) been wronged, Allah will succour him. Lo! Allah verily is Mild, Forgiving.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"kazniti, uzvratiti","en":"to punish, to retaliate"},"passage":["ذَٰلِكَ","وَمَنْ","عَاقَبَ","بِمِثْلِ","مَا","عُوقِبَ","بِهِۦ","ثُمَّ","بُغِىَ","عَلَيْهِ","لَيَنصُرَنَّهُ","ٱللَّهُ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَعَفُوٌّ","غَفُورٌ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"عاقَبَ"}},{"id":"aqaba-22-60-5","words":["verb:aqaba"],"options":[{"bs":"kažnjen je","en":"he/it was punished"},{"bs":"kaznite","en":"you (all) punish"},{"bs":"onda kaznite (svi)","en":"then punish (all of you)"},{"bs":"kažnjeni ste","en":"you (all) were punished"}],"ref":"22:60","answerWord":"عُوقِبَ","answerSound":"audio/b9a5f6ba82c4933d8474.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That (is so). And whoso hath retaliated with the like of that which he was made to suffer and then hath (again) been wronged, Allah will succour him. Lo! Allah verily is Mild, Forgiving.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"kazniti, uzvratiti","en":"to punish, to retaliate"},"passage":["ذَٰلِكَ","وَمَنْ","عَاقَبَ","بِمِثْلِ","مَا","عُوقِبَ","بِهِۦ","ثُمَّ","بُغِىَ","عَلَيْهِ","لَيَنصُرَنَّهُ","ٱللَّهُ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَعَفُوٌّ","غَفُورٌ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"عاقَبَ"}},{"id":"aqaba-60-11-7","words":["verb:aqaba"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ste uzvratili","en":"so you (all) retaliated"},{"bs":"uzvratio je","en":"he/it retaliated"},{"bs":"kažnjen je","en":"he/it was punished"},{"bs":"onda kaznite (svi)","en":"then punish (all of you)"}],"ref":"60:11","answerWord":"فَعَاقَبْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/26babd326f927abfb1a9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if any of your wives have gone from you unto the disbelievers and afterward ye have your turn (of triumph), then give unto those whose wives have gone the like of that which they have spent, and keep your duty to Allah in Whom ye are believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"kazniti, uzvratiti","en":"to punish, to retaliate"},"passage":["وَإِن","فَاتَكُمْ","شَىْءٌ","مِّنْ","أَزْوَٰجِكُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلْكُفَّارِ","فَعَاقَبْتُمْ","فَـَٔاتُوا۟","ٱلَّذِينَ","ذَهَبَتْ","أَزْوَٰجُهُم","مِّثْلَ","مَآ","أَنفَقُوا۟","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَنتُم","بِهِۦ","مُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"عاقَبَ"}}]